  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0a3e05ac99e285f46a346cc951bb5545, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial.TutorialDatabase
  Entries:
  - Id: 0
    Title: Welcome!
    Body: Dig down, get rich. Mine ore and sell it at the Depot for Dollars, spend
      Dollars at the Market on upgrades and automation, and keep an eye out for rare
      Artifacts - turn them in at the Museum for Prestige Points and permanent bonuses.
  - Id: 1
    Title: You found an Artifact!
    Body: Artifacts can't be sold or stored at the Depot. Carry them to the Museum
      and turn them in for Prestige Points, which unlock permanent upgrades that
      survive a Prestige reset.
  - Id: 2
    Title: Storage Depot
    Body: Deposit the ore you're carrying here, then sell it for Dollars. Ores stored
      here can also be used in the Processing Center to trade time for extra money!
  - Id: 3
    Title: Market
    Body: Spend Dollars here on permanent upgrades - better mining, more inventory
      space, faster automatons - and repair your fuel or health. These upgrades are
      lost when prestiging.
  - Id: 4
    Title: Museum
    Body: Turn in the Artifacts you've found here for Prestige Points, then spend
      those points on permanent Prestige upgrades that carry across resets.
  - Id: 5
    Title: Processing Center
    Body: Combine raw ore into finished goods worth more than the raw materials.
      Finished goods show up back at the Depot, ready to sell.
  - Id: 6
    Title: Control Center
    Body: Monitor your automatons and drones, adjust their settings, and refuel yourself
      here.
